QWQER Partner/Driver - the app for drivers.

Sign up and become driver here: https://bit.ly/3Ukborv

With the app, you can deliver products in your city and earn money for it.

Organize your work hours, deliver when, how and where you want, be your own boss, with full freedom to decide and self-organize. Enjoy flexibility with QWQER!

Why to become a QWQER Partner/Driver?

- You can work on your own schedule;
- You can combine it with your full time job or studies;
- Deliver different types of orders (food, parcels, gifts, basically anything that fit in your vehicle);
- Fast payouts - get your earning every week;
- Everything in one app - easy and convenient;
- Extra bonuses for our drivers.

How does it work?

- Go to https://bit.ly/3Ukborv, apply and we will be in contact with you shortly;
- Download the app and create an account;
- Once you are ready to deliver, go online to deliver orders;
- Accept your customers orders in real-time;
- Earn money for as long as you want;
- Stop using the app whenever you want.

About QWQER

QWQER mission is forming the last stage of the supply chain elements, ensuring a simple and affordable service execution, delivering the product on the current day. Company values are employees, customers and partners.

Your feedback is important to us!

Feel free to leave a review or share it with friends. We love receiving feedback from you. If you see something that could be improved, let us know! We aim to make further improvements so that you could have the best experience.
